{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01521",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.11,
      "end_seconds": 6.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Right, good morning, grab a seat. So what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.28,
      "end_seconds": 11.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I'm here because of itchy raised welts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.61,
      "end_seconds": 19.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.89,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.58,
      "end_seconds": 24.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Since last weekend, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.86,
      "end_seconds": 31.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.56,
      "end_seconds": 45.54,
      "duration_seconds": 12.98,
      "text": "I'd say all the time. It settles a little with antihistamine. I'd give it a four, out of ten. It's worse with heat and stress."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.95,
      "end_seconds": 49.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.82,
      "end_seconds": 60.57,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "It usually comes with welts that move around. The welts that move around? That's been for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.66,
      "end_seconds": 65.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Right, any throat tightness, difficulty breathing or joint pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.82,
      "end_seconds": 72.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "No, no throat tightness, difficulty breathing or joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.5,
      "end_seconds": 74.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "Any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.52,
      "end_seconds": 77.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "No, none, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.76,
      "end_seconds": 82.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Right, is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.88,
      "end_seconds": 85.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.41,
      "end_seconds": 91.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.21,
      "end_seconds": 97.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Atorvastatin. I take it 20 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.28,
      "end_seconds": 101.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "How long have you taken that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.88,
      "end_seconds": 104.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "For two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.24,
      "end_seconds": 108.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.77,
      "end_seconds": 114.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Yes, I had a bunion operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.43,
      "end_seconds": 122.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.71,
      "end_seconds": 131.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "I have high cholesterol, for five years. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.43,
      "end_seconds": 138.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.59,
      "end_seconds": 143.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.1,
      "end_seconds": 160.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.82,
      "end_seconds": 164.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.16,
      "end_seconds": 168.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.46,
      "end_seconds": 175.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.1,
      "end_seconds": 180.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.53,
      "end_seconds": 184.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "My aunt has rheumatoid arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.86,
      "end_seconds": 198.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.53,
      "end_seconds": 214.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.77,
      "end_seconds": 239.17,
      "duration_seconds": 9.4,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 122 over 68, temperature is 36.5 degrees. And respiratory rate 18, pulse is 82 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.33,
      "end_seconds": 244.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.17,
      "end_seconds": 246.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.15,
      "end_seconds": 248.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.07,
      "end_seconds": 269.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "There are pink raised wheals on the arms and trunk that blanch with pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.45,
      "end_seconds": 275.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.92,
      "end_seconds": 288.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like chronic spontaneous urticaria."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.55,
      "end_seconds": 292.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.75,
      "end_seconds": 311.54,
      "duration_seconds": 17.79,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with chronic spontaneous urticaria do well once it's treated properly. Let's get blood tests, for chronic urticaria. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.1,
      "end_seconds": 314.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Okay, I'll do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.08,
      "end_seconds": 339.49,
      "duration_seconds": 23.41,
      "text": "I'm prescribing fexofenadine, 180 milligrams, once a day, long term. That's for urticaria. Keep a diary of foods and triggers and avoid hot showers. One warning sign to remember: you have swelling of the lips with trouble breathing. In that case don't wait. We'll catch up in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.2,
      "end_seconds": 343.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.92,
      "end_seconds": 348.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Alright, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.71,
      "end_seconds": 364.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.91,
      "text": "So, I take the fexofenadine, 180 milligrams, once a day and come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.16,
      "end_seconds": 372.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.14,
      "end_seconds": 374.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.45,
      "end_seconds": 379.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}